   "line": [
    "cxd4"
   ],
   "spoken": "So White leaves it, and Black's capture on d4 was a serious inaccuracy.",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
   "ply": 13,
   "t": 617.5,
   "fen": "rnbq1rk1/pp2ppbp/3p1np1/2p5/2PPP3/2N1BP2/PP2N1PP/R2QKB1R b KQ - 1 7",
   "line": [],
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
